# api-exam-access

`OPEN` and `PURCHASE_REQUIRED` have a null course id. `ENROLLED_ONLY` has exactly one course id. A mismatch returns `ACCESS_MODE_LINK_MISMATCH`.

`PURCHASE_REQUIRED` keeps a price. `OPEN` and `ENROLLED_ONLY` do not. Price writes stay `EXAM_PRICE`.

`ENROLLED_ONLY` is true when the linked course is published and not closed, and either the course is `FULL_FREE` or the student has an `ACTIVE` enrollment for the current `opening_number`. A free lecture on a freemium course does not grant the module.

`accessGranted` also requires the module to be published. Draft and archived stay closed. The component clock does not read that status.

A student with access can read the component rules. An MCQ read has no question stem. Do not add a purchase route or a manual grant route. Unpaid `PURCHASE_REQUIRED` stays closed.
